<title>USA: Big Flower Press acquires Printco Inc.</title>
<headline>Big Flower Press acquires Printco Inc.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Big Flower Press Holdings Inc said on Wednesday that it has acquired Printco Inc, an advertising services company with revenues of $85 million for the 12 months ended June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>Terms of the acquisition were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The company said it expects the acquisition to be accretive to earnings in the first year.</p>
<p>Printco specializes in producing retail advertising circular programs and newspaper TV listing guides.</p>
</text>
